      "message": "I\u0027ve upstream it to virtio-drivers as well: https://github.com/rcore-os/virtio-drivers/pull/210, then to virtio-drives-and-devices https://github.com/immunant/virtio-drivers-and-devices/pull/24#event-21092162204 which next propagated to Android downstream virtio-drivers-and-device.\n\nBut indeed it didn\u0027t propagated to downstream Android\u0027s virtio-driver but I think we shouldn\u0027t worry about it since Trusty team switched to virtio-drivers-and-device and that\u0027s why I make sure it propagated there but stop looking on Android\u0027s downstream virtio-drivers - I think nobody is using it anymore in Android)",
