      "message": "\u003e I think nobody is using it anymore in Android\n\npvmfw does (at least)?\n\nhttps://googleplex-android.googlesource.com/platform/external/rust/android-crates-io/+/refs/heads/main/crates/virtio-drivers/Android.bp#17\n\n```\npackages/modules/Virtualization$ grep -r libvirtio_drivers\ntests/vmbase_test_vm/Android.bp:        \"libvirtio_drivers\",\nlibs/libvmbase/Android.bp:        \"libvirtio_drivers\",\nguest/pvmfw/Android.bp:        \"libvirtio_drivers\",\nguest/vmbase_example/Android.bp:        \"libvirtio_drivers\",\nguest/service_vm/Android.bp:        \"libvirtio_drivers\",\n```\n\nIt looks like it\u0027s actually the other way around: only Trusty is using virtio-drivers-and-devices, everyone else is using virtio-drivers?",
